  "findings": [
    "Installed native registration maps EqualEqual_ObjectObject to3dafa80 and NotEqual_ObjectObject to3dd61e0. Both extract two object-pointer operands and directly compare them, with opposite boolean results. They do not compare cardID.",
    "Battle/null comparisons were already reference-based. Static wrappers from repeated valid GetStaticCard lookups represented the same native stored pointer but compared unequal in VM operators. VM object operators now share the native identity predicate used by object containers, retaining battle-reference and null distinctions without scalar/CardId coercion.",
    "36 operator sites across33 generated card assets were independently matched to the parsed source operator inventory and enclosing saved runtime function bytecode. This is structural/bytecode inventory, not semantic verification of33 cards or proof that the static-wrapper bug is reachable in those cards.",
    "Tests cover36 battle/null pair scenarios (both sides, IDs0/70/-7, same/different reference/null),8 static-wrapper scenarios,4 repeated GetStaticCard expression scenarios,2 pool-wrapper/lookup scenarios. Each checks both operators and both operand orders:200 comparisons on the fixed kernel."
  ],
  "tests": {
    "before": "1/580 failed (same fixtures, baseline kernel)",
    "after": "580/580 passed",
    "pair_scenarios": 50,
    "operator_comparisons": 200
  },
  "native_verified_ranges": 2,
  "runtime_verified_blueprint_functions": 35,
  "operator_sites": 36,
  "operator_assets": 33,
  "limits": [
    "Static identity relies on the prior confirmed valid-name GetStaticCard map lookup. Unknown-name fallback, mutable shared CDO fields, cross-database aliases and lifetime/GC are still unresolved.",
    "The36 current IR operator operands are variables/self, with no direct nested GetStaticCard operand. No complete dataflow or reachability proof is claimed. This phase repairs and tests a common operator contract, not a fully verified real-card effect.",
    "Only the normalized VM math-expression route for these two operators is covered. Non-card UObject representations, invalid operand types, destroyed native objects, direct API invocation, other comparison operators, maps and deep property comparison are outside scope.",
    "No new live memory capture, game writes/injection, historical replay authority or Ghidra project changes. Fully semantically verified cards remains0."
  ],
  "fully_semantically_verified_cards": 0,
